    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Readme\nLoad your data into a vector database with the 📚 **Load Data** flow, and then use your data as chat context with the 🐕 **Retriever** flow.\n\n**Quick start**\n1. Ingest Your Data\n    * Click on the `Execute Workflow` button to run the 📚 **Load Data** flow.\n    * Upload a file: You can use this [Sample Insurance Report (PDF)](https://saraburi.gdcatalog.go.th/dataset/7dff29ec-efca-445d-ad08-5c6429b91a60/resource/7183102c-d3c2-49e2-9bb2-ed3b8fd95c47/download/-.pdf) for testing.\n2. Click on `Open Chat` button to run the 🐕 **Retriever** flow. Then ask a question about content from your document(s)\n\n",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
